          "Observe the asymmetric cryptographic logic cleanly: if ANY single bit out of those `k` indices equals `0`, **`target` is GUARANTEED 100% ABSENT** from that SSTable (`0%` false negatives!)—skipping the entire SSD file read instantaneously!",
