          "A **Sliding Window Log** eliminates boundary-edge bursts with mathematical precision: store the exact millisecond timestamp of every accepted request inside a sorted collection per key, evict timestamps strictly older than `(now_ms - window_ms)`, and accept incoming calls ONLY when remaining `len(log) < limit`!",
