          "Head-based sampling makes the recording decision at the ingress gateway at the moment the request enters the system (e.g. probabilistic 1% sampling, or rate-limiting to 10 traces/second per endpoint): if sampled, the `trace_flags` bit is set to `01`, instructing all downstream services to collect spans.",
